      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natchez%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Natchez has been a filming location for several movies, including the 1974 drama The Autobiography of Miss Jane Pittman and the 2014 biopic Get On Up.",
